										<img decoding="async" width="750" height="500" src="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Non-woven-fiberglass-needle-felt-详情2.jpg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-3114" alt="" srcset="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Non-woven-fiberglass-needle-felt-详情2.jpg 750w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Non-woven-fiberglass-needle-felt-详情2-300x200.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Non-woven-fiberglass-needle-felt-详情2-600x400.jpg 600w" sizes="(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px" />											<figcaption class="widget-image-caption wp-caption-text">Non-woven fiberglass needle felt</figcaption>
