				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<h3>Application of RABH Filter Bags</h3><ul><li><strong>Organosilicone Industry</strong>: Filmedia specialized in RABH Filter Bags for Organosilicone Industry, which is widely used in the field of New Energy. From photovoltaic cells and lithium battery separators to supercapacitors, organosilicones play an important role.</li><li><strong>Carbon Black Industry</strong>: Carbon black, very small particles, high viscosity, easy to paste bags, the filter is mainly stable at 270℃-280℃, large water vapor, the filter bag are used to collect carbon black particles.</li><li><strong>Iron &amp; Steel Industry</strong>: The steel plant has many dust collectors in different area, such as blast furnace, coking, converter, lime kiln, etc. The high temperature dust collectors can use fiberglass filter media.</li></ul>						</div>
